      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CADILLAC RAGTOP (1) has a fair record and proved too classy last time to win by 2.5 lengths at this track in a handy 17.64 beating Lady Tsunade. Ran the fastest time on the program in her latest win. Expected to be right there at the finish again. CADILLAC BELLE (7) racing well without winning, placing at her last six runs. Last start finished 3rd on September 17 over 305m at this track behind CADILLAC RAGTOP beaten 6 lengths (18.07) in a Other. Can measure up. LEKTRA DAMIAN (2) finished fifth last time at Warrnambool but could not have been more impressive a few runs back in his sharp 17.65 win at this track over 305m. Top win three back and rates a key player again. MYOLA THUNDER (4) is in form and worth thought again.",
